         "Active Mag terminal has no channel")
        ((NOT (MAG-GHOSTTY-RESET-STATS-P))
         "native Ghostty counter reset unavailable: rebuild/restart Maiko with UNIX-HANDLECOMM 42")
        ((MAG-UNIX-HANDLECOMM2 42 CHAN)
